# Computer Applications Department Website

## Project Overview

The Computer Applications Department Website is a responsive multi-page website developed to showcase the activities, achievements, events, gallery, and contact information of a Computer Applications Department.

The website is designed with a modern user interface and provides an interactive experience through dynamic components, responsive layouts, theme switching, event filtering, gallery previews, and form validation.

---

## Features

### Home Page

* Responsive navigation bar
* Dark/Light theme toggle
* Hero carousel section
* About department preview
* Events preview
* Gallery preview
* Contact section
* Footer section
* Scroll-to-top button

### About Page

* Department introduction
* Vision and Mission
* Department statistics
* Faculty information
* Department achievements
* Responsive design

### Events Page

* Events listing
* Event search functionality
* Event category filtering
* Event sorting
* Event details modal popup
* Responsive event cards

### Gallery Page

* Gallery image grid
* Image filtering by category
* Lightbox image preview
* Featured memories section
* Responsive gallery layout

### Contact Page

* Contact information cards
* Contact form
* Front-end form validation
* Character counter
* Success message display
* Responsive design

---

## Technologies Used

### Frontend

* HTML5
* CSS3
* JavaScript (ES6)

### Frameworks and Libraries

* Bootstrap 5.3
* Bootstrap Icons
* AOS (Animate On Scroll)

### Deployment

* GitHub Pages

